# Instagram feed (footer "On Instagram" strip)
# Long-lived access token for the @happyweddingsofficial IG Business/Creator
# account, via the Instagram Graph API (Instagram Login).
# Setup: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/instagram-platform/instagram-api-with-instagram-login
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the token. Until it's set, the
# footer shows a "Follow us on Instagram" CTA instead of broken tiles.
INSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=
